// A buried cargo halt, from its warehouse into the platform hall on the rails. The halt is 80 m long, so the
// scenario starts inside (the harness world is 128 m wide). Known layout blockers (sites.rs; see
// REFINE-movement.md): iron columns stand floor to roof every 6 m in the hall (from 30 m), so the hall's bays
// and the cart are sealed off; the warehouse column at 12 m leaves only a 1 m gap under the roof; and the
// chest is stamped inside a crate stack, so it never opens.
map
